@startuml
autoactivate on
autonumber

actor "User" as User
participant ":System" as System
participant "Spotify" as Spotify

activate User

User -> System: opens the menu of a track
System --> User: shows "Add to Spotify favourites" and "Add to a playlist"
User -> System: chooses "Add to Spotify favourites"
System -> Spotify: adds the track to the user's Liked Songs
alt accepted
  Spotify --> System: confirms
  System --> User: informs success
else rejected (e.g. missing permission)
  Spotify --> System: returns an error
  System --> User: informs the error
end
@enduml
